{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23332","headline":"日渐长赠周殷二判官 · 白居易","name":"日渐长赠周殷二判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日渐长，春尚早。\n墙头半露红萼枝，池岸新铺绿芽草。\n蹋草攀枝仰头叹，何人知此春怀抱。\n年颜盛壮名未成，官职欲高身已老。\n万茎白发真堪恨，一片绯衫何足道。\n赖得君来劝一桮，愁开闷破心头好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}